  "type": "demo_html",
  "title": "Trust-first demo page",
  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>CampusEats</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;background:#f4f8fb;color:#0f2233}\nnav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 32px;font-weight:700}\nnav b{color:#0369a1;font-size:20px}\n.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e0f2fe,#f8fafc);padding:56px 32px;text-align:center}\n.badge{display:inline-block;background:#0369a1;color:#fff;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px}\nh1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 auto 14px;max-width:680px}\n.hero p{font-size:18px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 24px;opacity:.85}\n.cta{display:inline-block;background:#0369a1;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n.strip{display:flex;gap:24px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n.cards{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:40px 24px}\n.card{background:#fff;color:#222;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;width:220px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}\n.card h3{margin:0 0 6px}.card p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#666;font-size:14px}\n.card span{color:#0369a1;font-weight:800;font-size:18px}\n</style></head><body>\n<nav><b>CampusEats</b><span>Menu &middot; Orders &middot; Help</span></nav>\n<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"badge\">TRUSTED BY 12,000+ STUDENTS</div><h1>Hot food at your hostel in 15 minutes, every time.</h1><p>Verified campus vendors, live order tracking and a delivery guarantee you can rely on.</p><a class=\"cta\">Order with confidence</a></div>\n<div class=\"strip\"><span>&#10003; Verified vendors</span><span>&#10003; Live tracking</span><span>&#10003; On-time guarantee</span></div>\n<div class=\"cards\"><div class=\"card\"><h3>Campus Biryani</h3><p>Verified vendor &middot; 4.8 rating</p><span>12 min</span></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Hostel Rolls</h3><p>Hygiene-checked kitchen</p><span>10 min</span></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Cold Coffee</h3><p>Delivered sealed and cold</p><span>8 min</span></div></div>\n</body></html>",
  "rationale": "Positioning 'Fast and trusted' for college students drives a cool, calm layout with delivery times, verified vendors and guarantees.",
  "depends_on_node_ids": [
    "r3",
    "r5"
  ]
}